{"nodes": [{"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_mockup", "label": "Optioutlet Landing Mockup (approved design)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Approved design-tool mockup (x-dc format) of the Optioutlet landing page: contact-lens store with AI optometrist mascot Opti. Source of truth for the React implementation."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_component", "label": "Component (DCLogic class)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L356", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_measure", "label": "measure()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L428", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reads viewport + getBoundingClientRect of sticky sections; computes progress p = clamp((72 - top)/(height - stageH)) per section (oo-t1, como, oo-t3), heroP = clamp(-heroTop/560), and horizontal overflow of the profiles row. Decides 'anim' vs 'static' mode (animate prop, no reduced-motion, 480<=vh<=1600). Only setState when values change."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_rendervals", "label": "renderVals()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L478", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Pure mapping from state to template values: easeInOutQuad, pupil scale to cover viewport diagonal *1.08, step thresholds 0.34/0.68, rowX = -p3*overflow, ribbon offset sin(sy/420), strip parallax mod 374.4, chat messages/chips/cards."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_onscroll", "label": "onScroll (rAF throttled)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L370", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Coalesces scroll/resize into one requestAnimationFrame per frame before calling measure()."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_componentdidmount", "label": "componentDidMount()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L404", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_componentdidupdate", "label": "componentDidUpdate() chat autoscroll", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L419", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_onheromove", "label": "onHeroMove (eye tracking)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L374", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Isotipo in hero follows the cursor, max offset 8% of eye width, scaled by distance."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_answer", "label": "answer(opt)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L470", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Appends answer, shows typing indicator for 800ms."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_onsend", "label": "onSend / onKey (free text answer)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L390", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_restart", "label": "restart()", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L398", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_questions_q", "label": "Opti five questions (Q: usa, dia, frec, astig, receta)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L363", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_recommendation_logic", "label": "Recommendation logic (daily vs biweekly, toric, silicone hydrogel)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L548", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "daily = frec!=diario or dia==afuera; toric if astig==si; screens -> silicona hidrogel tag. Two cards (primary + alternative) with a Spanish 'Porque ...' reason. Notes for expired prescription and unknown astigmatism. Product names are [Producto J&J] placeholders."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_anim_static_mode", "label": "Anim vs static mode (reduced-motion fallback)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L434", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All scroll effects degrade to static stacked layout when prefers-reduced-motion, animate=false, extreme viewport heights or short documents; static mode shows final states (step 2, pupil hidden, rows wrapped)."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_sticky_stage_pattern", "label": "Sticky scroll stage pattern (stageH = vh - 72)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L101", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Tall section (stageH + extra travel) with sticky inner stage at top:72px under the 72px header; progress drives effects. Travel: t1 +1200px, como +1500px, t3 +overflow+240px."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_header", "label": "Header (sticky 72px, nav + CTA)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L60", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_hero", "label": "Hero section (#oo-hero)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L76", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Headline 'Cuentanos como vives...'; animated radial-gradient bg shifting with heroP and cursor; 6 floating brand glyphs with parallax; rotating seal around isotipo eye."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_pupil_reveal", "label": "Pupil reveal section (#oo-t1)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L100", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Navy pupil circle scales up to cover the viewport (bite fades out 0.35-0.6), then Opti mascot + 'Antes de recomendarte algo, queremos conocerte' fades in at p1 0.62-0.87 with dark pattern."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_how_it_works", "label": "How it works section (#como)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L118", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Three steps highlighted by scroll progress; phone mockup shows matching chat screen (S0/S1/S2); gradient disc rotates p2*120deg; compact mode hides inactive steps."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_profiles", "label": "Profiles section (#oo-t3) horizontal scroll", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L175", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Five lifestyle profile cards (pantalla, movimiento, ocasiones, astigmatismo, primera vez) translate horizontally with p3; pattern parallax; wraps on narrow screens."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_consulta", "label": "Consulta chat section (#consulta)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L204", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Interactive chat shell: progress label/bar, Opti/user bubbles, typing dots, option chips, free text input, recommendation cards, restart."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_receta", "label": "Receta section (Opti te orienta. Tu especialista te receta.)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L292", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Medical-safety disclaimers: Opti never computes graduation, suggests checkup if prescription expired, refers to a professional on symptoms (ojo rojo, dolor, vision borrosa)."}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_store_cta", "label": "Store CTA section (Ya sabes cuales quieres?)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L322", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_pattern_strip", "label": "Pattern strip (parallax)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L334", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_footer", "label": "Footer", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optioutlet-mockup.dc.html", "source_location": "L338", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "mockup_optioutlet_mockup_dc_brand_glyphs", "label": "Brand glyphs (oo-g-u, oo-g-loop, oo-g-dot)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/mockup/optiou